{"id": "t016-003", "text": "bumped into Kofi at the park with his new puppy, a cockapoo called Pudding. He's not sleeping, puppy cries all night apparently. His girlfriend Ruby wanted a cat but lost the vote. They're doing puppy training on Saturday mornings and he asked if I'd come along one week with mine. Pudding's first vet check is next Wednesday at half 4, he's a bit worried she's got a limp", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kofi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cockapoo called Pudding", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ruby", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "puppy training", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday mornings", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "one week"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first vet check", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Wednesday at half 4", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t016-004", "text": "Ruby - christening on Sunday the 14th at 11am, St Mary's, lunch at her mum's after. Baby's name is Isla. Bring something white?", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ruby", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "christening", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday the 14th at 11am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lunch", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Baby", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isla", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Bring something white", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "on"}]}
{"id": "t016-005", "text": "so I was talking to Ahmed and um his wife Sana had the baby on Tuesday night a little boy called Yusuf eight pounds two everyone's fine but Ahmed sounds absolutely shattered I need to drop round some food for them sometime this week maybe Thursday evening", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sana", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "had the baby", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "little boy", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "shattered", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop round some food for them", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime this week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t016-007", "text": "Sophie said her sister Fern is expecting twins!! Due end of the summer. Fern's pretty anxious about it apparently, first pregnancy and they live miles from family. Her husband Bogdan works away a lot too, offshore, two weeks on two weeks off. Sophie's going to stay with her for a bit in the autumn. I should send Fern a message this weekend, just to say congrats and that I'm around if she wants to talk", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sophie", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fern", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting twins", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Due", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of the summer", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fern", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretty anxious", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "live miles from family", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bogdan", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "works away a lot", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "offshore, two weeks on two weeks off", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sophie", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "stay with her", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the autumn", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Fern a message", "owner": "p2", "anchor":