{"id": "t016-015", "text": "Eilidh - 34 weeks now, finishing work end of next week. Wants to paint the nursery but can't do ladders. She mentioned she'd love a nursing chair", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eilidh", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "34 weeks", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "finishing work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of next week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "love a nursing chair", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t016-016", "text": "Coffee w Tomás. His partner Kavya's scan is Thursday at half 9, the 20 week one. They're not finding out the gender. Must message Tomás afterwards to see how it went. Also Kavya's off dairy at the moment and Tomás is doing all the cooking, which, from what I remember of his cooking, is brave. They've booked a babymoon in Lisbon sometime in late November before she can't fly", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tomás", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kavya", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "scan", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday at half 9", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "not finding out the gender", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message Tomás", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tomás", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kavya", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "off dairy", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tomás", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "babymoon in Lisbon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in late November", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "before she can't fly", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t016-021", "text": "Hassan's wife had a little girl!! Born Sunday at 4am, Laila. Send congrats and sort a card from the team", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hassan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "had a little girl", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday at 4am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laila", "owner": "r1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send congrats", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort a card from the team", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
