{"id": "t016-025", "text": "Errands sat: dry cleaning, pick up prescription, new hoover bags, birthday card for Mum. Gym Sunday morning. Then I want to finally sort the spare room before the end of the month, take the old desk to the tip, get the bed frame put together and see if the charity shop takes the lamp. Haircut sometime next week too, ideally Tuesday after work", "spans": [{"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sat", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "dry cleaning", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "pick up prescription", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "new hoover bags", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a4", "type": "ACTION", "text": "birthday card for Mum", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Mum"}, {"id": "a5", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Gym", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday morning", "anchor": "a5"}, {"id": "a6", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort the spare room", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "before the end of the month", "anchor": "a6"}, {"id": "a7", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take the old desk to the tip", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a8", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get the bed frame put together", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a9", "type": "ACTION", "text": "see if the charity shop takes the lamp", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a10", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Haircut", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "a10"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday after work", "anchor": "a10"}]}
