{"id": "t016-029", "text": "Barbara (Mrs B next door) asked if I can feed her cat while she's away, the 8th to the 15th. Twice a day, keys under the plant pot. The cat's called Duchess, she's on special kidney food, half a pouch in the morning and the dry stuff at night. Barbara's off to Edinburgh for her granddaughter's christening, first great grandchild, she's thrilled. Text her a photo of Duchess every couple of days so she doesn't fret", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Barbara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mrs B", "same_as": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "next door", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "while she's away", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 8th to the 15th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Twice a day"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the morning"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "night"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Barbara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Edinburgh", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "granddaughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "christening", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "great grandchild", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "thrilled", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text her a photo of Duchess", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "every couple of days", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t016-030", "text": "Thabo - new job at the vets on Monday. Starts at 8. Loves it already, he's wanted to work with animals for years", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thabo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job at the vets", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "8", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Loves it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "animals", "owner": "p1"}]}
