{"id": "t016-049", "text": "So Hassan's back at work Monday after paternity leave and he says Laila's colic is awful, they're up every couple of hours, his wife's mum is staying with them for a bit to help, he looked properly exhausted at the school gates this morning. I should offer to do the school run for his eldest one day next week, maybe Wednesday", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hassan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back at work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after paternity leave", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laila", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "colic", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "offer to do the school run for his eldest", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "eldest", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "one day next week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t016-051", "text": "Leon texted - baby arrived Weds 6:40am!! Girl, Maya, 7lb 1oz. Mum and baby fine. Need to sort a gift and a card before we visit on Saturday afternoon", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leon", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "arrived", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Weds 6:40am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Girl", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Maya", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort a gift and a card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visit", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday afternoon", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t016-055", "text": "Oisín's partner Dee is pregnant again! Due late spring. Aoife's not even one yet. They're over the moon but terrified", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oisín", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dee", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Due", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "late spring", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aoife", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "not even one", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "over the moon", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrified", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t016-056", "text": "Bao - baby came early!! Born last night at 11pm, boy, Minh. 4 weeks early so he's in special care for a few days. Bao's okay but stressed. His mum's flight isn't till December so they're trying to move it. Don't forget to message him tomorrow and see if they need anything dropped round", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bao", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "came early", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last night at 11pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f0", "type": "FACT", "text": "boy", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Minh", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "special care", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a few days", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bao", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "okay", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flight", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "till December", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t016-057", "text": "Barbara's back. Cat's fine, ate everything lol. She brought me shortbread from Scotland", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Barbara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Cat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}]}
{"id": "t016-059", "text": "Eilidh had the baby on the 2nd at 9pm! Little girl Rosa. Her mum's staying for the first fortnight. Visit sometime the week after next when things calm down, and take the nursing chair voucher we all chipped in for", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eilidh", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "had the baby", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 2nd at 9pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Little girl", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rosa", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Visit", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime the week after next", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "when things calm down", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take the nursing chair voucher we all chipped in for", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t016-060", "text": "Long chat with Adaeze tonight. Her sister Chioma is pregnant, finally, after three years of trying and two rounds of IVF, so everyone's being very careful and not telling the wider family until after the scan on the 18th at 2pm. Adaeze's going with her. She's also thinking about getting Bisi a friend, maybe a second dog over the summer. Remember to ask Adaeze how the scan went, and maybe look for a little something for Chioma for later on", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adaeze", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chioma", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "scan", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 18th at 2pm", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adaeze", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Bisi", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "second dog", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Adaeze how the scan went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adaeze", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "look for a little something for Chioma", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chioma", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "later on", "anchor": "a2"}]}
